<title>SPAIN: Spain's Banco Herrero pretax profits rise 13.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Banco Herrero pretax profits rise 13.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Grupo Banco Herrero</p>
<p>for the first nine months (in billions pesetas, unless stated):</p>
<p> Pretax profit			     6.188  vs   5.433</p>
<p> Net taxed group profit		  4.172  vs   3.860</p>
<p> Net interest income		    12.869  vs  13.102</p>
<p> Ordinary income			  16.594  vs  16.535</p>
<p> Operating income			  5.868  vs   5.813</p>
<p>NOTE- The group said it had opened 18 new offices in the first nine months of 1996 and had made sizeable investments in equities, in particular in Hidroelectrica del Cantabrico .</p>
<p>--Madrid newsroom +34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
